  Android tints every pixel of this layer a single colour and keeps only its alpha, so nothing here
  may lean on fill colour to be seen. What is left is the board's outline with the gutter slotted
  out of it, and the rayed sun with clear air beneath it. Fill it flat black and both are still
  there, which is the whole test.

  The two parchment pages from ic_launcher_foreground.xml are dropped on purpose: they sit inside
  the board and would only fill the slot back in. Everything else is copied verbatim, and must stay
  in step with the foreground.
-->
